  "$comment": "PD-001 parser fixture expectations (TASK-M0-004). Structure-only contract: files must exist and declare their expected normalized elements now; the parse assertions run once M2-001a registers a DocumentParser under the module convention below. Editing an expectation to make a red parser pass is a reviewable change, not a silent fix.",
